<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:16px; text-align:start"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="color:#444444">Hi&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:16px; text-align:start"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="color:#444444">My name is Wileen and I am reaching out from the State Farm team at EverQuote. I did want to reach out to see what your plans were for Q1 and if you had any Auto and Home Goals that EverQuote could help achieve!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style="font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<br style="font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; box-sizing:border-box; color:#444444; font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size:13px" />
<span style="font-size:16px; text-align:start"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="color:#444444">Based on the State Farm scorecard, State Farm agents have consistently averaged the highest close rate at EverQuote than with other vendors - this does already create a higher than normal demand which will most likely increase further with the recent subsidy news.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p>Great news - Our Lead Connection Services (<strong>LCS</strong>) which is new and available to State Farm Agents. This hybrid service combines live transfers with traditional data leads, connecting you directly with consumers who are qualified and ready for a quote. This is a proven system that has helped other carriers for over 4 years - now it's your turn to benefit.</p>

<p>Additionally, we've introduced a new loyalty credit to our Accelerated Growth Program (<strong>AGP</strong>) customers - qualifying agents will receive an account credit on a monthly basis as a token of appreciation for your partnership. These tools are designed to help you start the year strong, and I want to make sure you are taking full advantage.&nbsp;</p>

<p>If you have any questions or would like further clarification, feel free to reach out to me at my direct line or book some time with me on my calendar below for a day that works best for you. Look forward to speaking with you!<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>
</body>
</html>